# Keeps this directory present in git even when empty, so the
# Dockerfile's `COPY figure_images/ /app/figure_images/` line always
# has a source to copy (a nonexistent path fails a Docker COPY
# outright -- this is what was breaking the GHCR build). Populate this
# directory by running scripts/extract_page_figures.py before building
# the image; app.py only mounts /figures if the directory exists at
# runtime, so an empty directory here is a safe no-op default.
